# Project Invariants

- Pipeline order is fixed: `news_fetcher` (EventBridge -> NewsAPI) -> SQS -> `sentiment_analyzer` (Claude -> DynamoDB) -> invokes `trade_executor` (DynamoDB -> Alpaca).
- `run_id` is the correlation key across the entire pipeline; keep it stable per batch/job.
- `trade_executor` must remain idempotent per (`run_id`, `symbol`) using DynamoDB conditional writes.

# CloudWatch P&L conventions (custom metrics)

- Only publish numeric fields via `PutMetricData`; CloudWatch metrics cannot use strings.
- Metrics are named by snapshot keys converted to PascalCase (e.g. `equity_usd` -> `EquityUsd`).
- Use a `PaperTrading=true|false` dimension (from `ALPACA_PAPER`) and namespace `Trading/Paper` by default.

